Subject: [PATCH v6 13/16] parisc: Switch to generic free_initrd_mem.
Date: Sun,  1 Apr 2018 10:59:27 -0400
Message-Id: <20180401145931.7932-13-shea@shealevy.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.16.2
